{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2007-common-biology-15","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2007,"subject":"biology","number":15,"points":null,"unitId":"immune","unitLabel":"면역학","topic":"항체·항원·IgG","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["immune","circulation","development"],"stem":"표는첫아기를정상적으로출산한산모의분만전후혈액과아기의\n혈액을여러항체로응집반응시킨결과이다.\n혈액시료\n산모\n아기\n항체\n분만전\n분만후\n항-A 항체\n＋\n＋\n－\n항-B 항체\n－\n－\n＋\n항-Rh 항체\n－\n＋\n＋\n＋: 혈액응집있음\n－: 혈액응집없음\n분만후산모의혈액에항-Rh 항체가형성되었다고가정할때, 위\n결과에대한해석이나추론으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고르면?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 임신중산모의항-B 항체는IgM 형이므로태반을통과하지\n못하여태아의적혈구에있는B 항원과응집반응을할수\n없다.\nㄴ. 이여성이Rh 항원을가진두번째아기를임신할경우모체에서\n생산된IgG 형의항-Rh 항체가태반을통과한후태아의혈액\n으로유입되어용혈성(hemolytic) 질환을발생시킬수있다.\nㄷ. 이여성이두번째임신을계획할경우첫아기의분만전후\nRh 항원에대한항체주사를맞으면용혈성질환을예방할\n수있다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t036"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t037"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t038"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t039"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t040"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":772,"height":249,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,48.068,308.8,99.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-common-biology-15/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":439,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,225.268,308.8,175.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035"],"src":"/mdeet/asset